## 🎯 Target Roster (8 Superstars across Eras & Genres)

To reach the target scale of **8 Artists, ~800 Albums/Singles, ~4,000 Tracks**:
1. **Taylor Swift** (Pop / Country — Large catalog)
2. **The Weeknd** (R&B / Pop — Extensive singles & albums)
3. **Drake** (Hip-Hop — High volume releases)
4. **Ed Sheeran** (Pop / Acoustic — Multi-album discography)
5. **Billie Eilish** (Alt-Pop — Modern concise discography)
6. **Ariana Grande** (Pop / R&B — Hitmaker catalog)
7. **Coldplay** (Rock / Alt-Rock — 25-year catalog)
8. **BTS** (K-Pop / Global — Massive international release catalog)

