## Proposed Changes

### Component: Python Extraction Engine (`src/extract/`)

#### [NEW] [__init__.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/__init__.py)
- Package root.

#### [NEW] [__init__.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/__init__.py)
- Exposes `SpotifyClient`, `ArtistExtractor`, `AlbumExtractor`, `TrackExtractor`.

#### [NEW] [spotify_client.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/spotify_client.py)
- Implements `SpotifyClient`:
  - `_get_access_token()`: OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials flow using base64 header.
  - `_ensure_valid_token()`: Checks if current time >= `token_expiry_epoch - 60`.
  - `get(endpoint, params, max_retries, base_delay)`:
    - Automatically attaches `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
    - Handles `HTTP 429` by reading `Retry-After` header + jitter sleep.
    - Handles transient `5xx` errors with exponential backoff.
    - Handles unexpected `401` by refreshing token and retrying.

#### [NEW] [artist_extractor.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/artist_extractor.py)
- Implements `ArtistExtractor`:
  - `extract_artist(artist_name)`: Queries `/v1/search` with `type=artist&limit=1`.
  - Formats output: `artist_id`, `artist_name`, `spotify_uri`, `image_url`, `genres`, `extracted_at`.

#### [NEW] [album_extractor.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/album_extractor.py)
- Implements `AlbumExtractor`:
  - `extract_albums(artist_id, artist_name)`: Paginates `/v1/artists/{id}/albums` with `limit=10` & `include_groups=album,single,compilation`.
  - Loops until `offset >= total` or items list empty.
  - Deduplicates albums by `album_id`.

#### [NEW] [track_extractor.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/track_extractor.py)
- Implements `TrackExtractor`:
  - `extract_tracks(album_id, artist_id)`: Paginates `/v1/albums/{id}/tracks` with `limit=10`.
  - Loops until `offset >= total`.
  - Preserves track metadata, track numbers, and explicit flags.

#### [NEW] [main.py](file:///d:/data_engineering/Project_DE/spotify-pipeline/src/extract/main.py)
- Implements `run_extraction(target_artists, output_dir, snapshot_date)`:
  - Iterates over the 8 target artists.
  - Enriches every entity with `snapshot_date: YYYY-MM-DD`.
  - Writes partitioned raw JSON files to:
    - `data/raw/artists/artists_{snapshot_date}.json`
    - `data/raw/albums/albums_{snapshot_date}.json`
    - `data/raw/tracks/tracks_{snapshot_date}.json`
  - Generates comprehensive run summary and statistics.

